Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD Vim visual selection and copy so both terminal panes
 can be yanked

Terminal command mode owns Vim-style character, line, and block selections for the focused pane. Copy requests extract selected text from the rendered pane content and use OSC52 in the terminal app, while the UI harness stores copied text for deterministic coverage.
